OL,7,FAndy Burnham tells MPs new EU-UK deals
OL,8,Fcould boost growth and tackle illegal
OL,9,Fimmigration
OL,11,FA summit next month will discuss "a
OL,12,Ftrade deal on food and drink products",
OL,13,Fenergy and "deeper co-operation on
OL,14,Fimmigration"
OL,16,FBut in a statement in Parliament,
OL,17,FBurnham says at every stage the British
OL,18,Fpublic "will be the boss"
OL,20,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch says
OL,21,Fthe PM is "not going to get a better
OL,22,Fdeal" as the EU "are tough negotiators"
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
